n\n### 关键发现\n\n#### P1 - High 优先级问题\n\n**#57188** - [Bug]: 2026.3.28 update breaks gateway on Linux VPS/systemd — recovery fails, required snapshot restore\n- **类型**：bug + regression\n- **严重度**：高（完全 outage，需要快照恢复）\n- **root cause**：`openclaw gateway install` 尝试使用 `systemctl --user`，但在 root-level systemd service 环境中 user bus 不可用；`openclaw doctor\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1147-L1176","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md#L1147-L1176"},{"id":"94505b8fd2affdb180753202d8749750a9aaabf1f0ce62c536a6ce00f58caaa3","path":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md","startLine":1,"endLine":31,"score":0.8169261694558646,"textScore":0.8169261694558646,"snippet":"# 扫描报告发送记录 [2026-03-30 06:55 UTC]\n\n## 发送状态：失败\n\n### 尝试发送给 main agent\n- Session key 1: `main:feishu:default:direct:ou_5abeeb52afc248214694d8d79ab20df8` → 失败（No session found）\n- Session key 2: `agent:main:main` → 失败（timeout）\n\n### 扫描数据（已记录在 OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md）\n\n#### GitHub Issues（方向1）\n发现了85个新候选（过去2小时内更新），其中最重要的是：\n- **#57551** - [Bug]: kimi无限递归重试，把我模型token都跑光了（P0，regression）\n- **#57550** - [Bug]: v3.28+ HTTP API broken: pure Token auth throws \"missing scope: operator.write\"（P0，regression）\n- **#57540** - Isolated cron sessions fail with LiveSessionModelSwitchError（P1）\n- **#57538** - claude-haiku-4-5 missing from bundled catalog（P1，silent cost regression 5-6x）\n- **#57536** - [Bug]: feishu:tenant_a\n\nSource: memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31","source":"memory","citation":"memory/OPENCLAW-PROJECT.md-SCAN-LOG-2026-03-30-06-55.md#L1-L31"},{"id":"89d927bec654302ca52a170a5f526d6551df7a53b1a7985022d02aa1530ad458","path":"memory/scan-report-2026-03-31-16-14.md","startLine":36,"endLine":85,"score":0.814974948635632,"textScore":0.814974948635632,"snippet":"5. **#58430** - Feishu TTS: 语音消息应发送为 audio 类型而非 file 类型\n   - 类型：bug\n   - 影响：Feishu TTS 消息类型错误\n\n### InStreet 社区 ❌\n- 原因：域名解析失败（instreet.coze 无法解析）\n- 发现：无\n\n### Discord 社区 ❌\n- 原因：Discussi