ervice immediately disconnects. ### Expected behavior. Browser should stay connected and be usable after starting. The service should remain active. ### Actual behavior. Logs show \\\"Browser control service ready (profiles=N)\\\" but tool call fails with timeout error: \\\"Can't reach the OpenClaw browser control service (timed out after 15000ms)\\\". Works fine with \\\"chrome\\\" (Relay) profile mode. ### Operating system. ### Install method. ### Logs, screenshots, and evidence. ### Impact and severity. Affected: Users who need browser automation in openclaw profile mode. Severity: High (blocks browser functionality). Consequence: Cannot use browser tool with openclaw profile, must use chrome/relay mode as workaround. ### Additional information. ## Metadata. ## Metadata. ### Labels. bugSomething isn't workingSomething isn't workingregressionBehavior that previously worked and now failsBehavior that previously worked and now fails. ### Fields. No fields configured for issues without a type. No branches or pull requests. ## Issue actions. You can’t perform that action at this time.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"43cbb6fcda6dfe7f\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99995315\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"feee315ff608b6fa\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug]: OpenClaw 2026.3.8 regression: empty agent payloads + websocket 1006 closures with local LM Studio backend · Issue #42270 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"feee315ff608b6fa\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/42270\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"8602438aad9c23a8\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Reload](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/42270) to refresh your session.You signed out in another tab or window. *   [Sponsor](https://github.com/sponsors/openclaw). *   [Code](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw). *   [Issues 5k+](https://github.