y Status: Exited with reason 1 (likely due to zero active skills). openclaw skills register and agents update return unknown option '--id' or --add-skill. openclaw skills [verb] [skill] returns: error: too many arguments for 'skills'. Manually created agent.json with capabilities and skills arrays. Requested Fix: Clarification on the \"44 missing requirements\" blocking the exec skill on Debian and restoration of CLI verbs for manual skill binding. No fields configured for issues without a type. ## Issue actions.\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"fd1ce1cc2a498162\">>>","score":0.99992216},{"title":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"53454178a40c0513\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\n[Bug]: Provider regression — smoke test failure · Issue #47117 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"53454178a40c0513\">>>","url":"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/47117","snippet":"\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\"20082c0c9dc2c887\">>>\nSource: Web Search\n---\nThe OpenClaw provider smoke test detected **1 failure(s)** across configured models. \"meta\" \"lastTouchedVersion\"\"2026.3.13\" \" \" \"lastTouchedAt\"\"2026-03-14T22:42:43.035Z\" \" \" \"wizard\" \"lastRunAt\"\"2026-03-14T22:42:43.023Z\" \" \" \"lastRunVersion\"\"2026.3.13\" \" \" \"lastRunCommand\" \"configure\" \" \" \"lastRunMode\" \"local\" \" \" \"auth\" \"profiles\"\"mistral:default\" \"provider\" \"mistral\" \" \" \"mode\" \"api_key\" \" \"\"anthropic:default\" \"provider\" \"anthropic\" \" \" \"mode\" \"api_key\" \" \"\"openai:default\" \"provider\" \"openai\" \" \" \"mode\" \"api_key\" \" \" \"models\" \"mode\" \"merge\" \" \" \"providers\" \"mistral\" \"baseUrl\"\"https://api.mistral.ai/v1\" \" \" \"api\"\"openai-completions\" \" \" \"models\" \"id\"\"mistral-large-latest\" \" \" \"name\" \"Mistral Large\" \" \" \"reasoning\" false \"input\" \"text\" \" \" \"image\" \" \" \"cost\" \"input\" 0 \"output\" 0 \"cacheRead\" 0 \"cacheWrite\" 0 \"contextWindow\" 262144 \"ma