{"type":"message","id":"b2a539ce","parentId":"d824bc8f","timestamp":"2026-04-01T23:05:08.202Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_k36k1fERopcSp1stsTmqJLbj|fc_092a77d0e028a4910169cda4a22778819191def84503ef16d6","toolName":"web_search","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"query\": \"site:github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues plugin feishu wecom openclaw Apr 2026 bug\",\n  \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n  \"count\": 10,\n  \"tookMs\": 1957,\n  \"externalContent\": {\n    \"untrusted\": true,\n    \"source\": \"web_search\",\n    \"provider\": \"tavily\",\n    \"wrapped\": true\n  },\n  \"results\": [\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ba65d24d2177ea13\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug] Feishu plugin duplicate registration causes Gateway crash · Issue #37028 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"ba65d24d2177ea13\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/37028\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"af042ec3bdbc4523\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nTitle: [Bug] Feishu plugin duplicate registration causes Gateway crash · Issue #37028 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n## Navigation Menu. # Search code, repositories, users, issues, pull requests... You signed in with another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You signed out in another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. You switched accounts on another tab or window. Reload to refresh your session. There was an error while loading. * Notifications  You must be signed in to change notification settings. # [Bug] Feishu plugin duplicate registration causes Gateway crash #37028. [[Bug] Feishu plugin duplicate registration causes Gateway crash](#top)#37028. ## Description. opened on Mar 6, 2026. ## Bug Description. When configuring Feishu channel and modifying the openclaw.json file, the Gateway crashes unexpectedly. ## Steps to Reproduce. 1. Install Feishu plugin via npm. 2. Add a Feishu channel using: `openclaw channels add --channel feishu --name default`. 3. Try to manually add a second Feishu channel or modify the agent configuration. ## Error Logs. Config warnings: - plugins.entries.feishu: plugin feishu: duplicate plugin id detected; later plugin may be overridden (/Users/maxhou/.openclaw/extensions/feishu/index.ts). The warning appears on every command, and Gateway becomes unstable when modifying channel configuration. ## Environment. * OpenClaw version: 2026.3.2. * OS: macOS 25.2.0 (arm64). * Feishu plugin: @openclaw/feishu@2026.3.1. ## Expected Behavior. Gateway should handle Feishu plugin gracefully without duplicate registration warnings, and modifying channel configuration should not cause crashes. ## Actual Behavior. 1. Duplicate plugin warning appears on every CLI command. * Manually editing openclaw.json to add channel bindings. * Adding multiple Feishu channel accounts. 3. The Feishu plugin is only installed once (confirmed via plugins.installs), but loaded twice by Gateway. ## Possible Root Cause. The Feishu plugin is being loaded twice during Gateway initialization, causing:. 1. Plugin ID conflict (duplicate detected). 2. Unstable behavior when modifying channel configurations. ## Additional Notes. * This affects the ability to bind different agents to different Feishu bots. * Workaround: Use terminal to manually start agents with `openclaw agent`  instead of channel-based routing. ## Metadata. ## Metadata. No branches or pull requests. ## Issue actions. You can’t perform that action at this time.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"af042ec3bdbc4523\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.9999962\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cedeb4051d95e4ed\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug]:feishu plugin install issue · Issue #13448 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"cedeb4051d95e4ed\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/