r. Even though the plugin has been downloaded, the installation prompt still appears, preventing the addition of Feishu channel. ### OpenClaw version. ### Operating system. Debian GNU/Linux 13 (trixie). ### Install method. npm install -g openclaw@latest. ### Logs, screenshots, and evidence. ### Impact and severity. ### Additional information. ## Metadata. ## Metadata. ### Labels. bugSomething isn't workingSomething isn't workingbug:behaviorIncorrect behavior without a crashIncorrect behavior without a crash. No branches or pull requests. ## Issue actions. You can’t perform that action at this time.\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"7403d31a4511ca67\\\">>>\",\n      \"score\": 0.99998426\n    },\n    {\n      \"title\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"88d9865b95ab1182\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\n[Bug] Feishu plugin causes Gateway crash · Issue #48066 · openclaw/openclaw · GitHub\\n<<<END_EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"88d9865b95ab1182\\\">>>\",\n      \"url\": \"https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/48066\",\n      \"snippet\": \"\\n<<<EXTERNAL_UNTRUSTED_CONTENT id=\\\"27c4ba3d2d735caf\\\">>>\\nSource: Web Search\\n---\\nYou signed in with another tab or window. You signed out in another tab or window. # [Bug] Feishu plugin causes Gateway crash #48066. [[Bug] Feishu plugin causes Gateway crash](#top)#48066. Feishu plugin causes Gateway to crash with WebSocket handshake timeout error. 标题: [Bug] Feishu plugin causes Gateway crash (WebSocket handshake timeout). Feishu plugin causes Gateway to crash with WebSocket handshake timeout error. 1. Run OpenClaw Gateway with Feishu channel enabled. Gateway should remain stable when Feishu plugin is loaded. * [[Bug] Feishu plugin duplicate registration causes Gateway crash #37028](https://github.com/openclaw/openclaw/issues/37028) - Feishu plugin duplicate registration causes Gateway crash. * [[Bug]: gateway crashes after second cron add (exit code 1) #47319](https://github.com/openclaw/opencla